# Uwitz AI-Agent Authorised Servers (`.uzc` = Uwitz Zone Config)
# Format: <ip/domain> <descriptor> <role>
# Roles: production, staging, dev-testing, lab, build
# Passwords for the `ai` user: .uwz/ssh/<descriptor>.uzp
#
# Examples:
# 10.0.0.204 lab.uwz lab
# 192.168.1.100 build-server build
# prod-01.uwz.org prod-01 production
# staging-01.uwz.org staging-01 staging
